{"id":"7315f2111b653872","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-rel-post.md","title":"相对 Post 定理","display":"thm-rel-post — 相对 Post 定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-rel-post","aliases":["20-thm-rel-post"],"display":"thm-rel-post — 相对 Post 定理","chapter":"4","section":"4.4","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 4.4.2；Theorem 4.2.2 的相对归纳展开","source_pdf_pages":[120,121,128],"source_printed_pages":[84,85,92],"depends_on":["[[20-df-rel-arith]]","[[20-df-jump]]","[[20-df-relative-ce]]","[[20-thm-jump]]","[[20-thm-relative-complement]]","[[20-thm-hierarchy-closure]]","[[20-thm-bounded-quantifier-closure]]","[[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-rel-post"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-rel-post</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-rel-post — 相对 Post 定理"},{"key":"chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"section","html":"4.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 4.4.2；Theorem 4.2.2 的相对归纳展开"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>120</span><span>121</span><span>128</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>84</span><span>85</span><span>92</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8251b2f9fd838667\" href=\"?note=8251b2f9fd838667\" title=\"20-df-rel-arith\">20-df-rel-arith</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2c15e9656c322806\" href=\"?note=2c15e9656c322806\" title=\"20-df-relative-ce\">20-df-relative-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2ea8548c98f572c3\" href=\"?note=2ea8548c98f572c3\" title=\"20-thm-jump\">20-thm-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e8b39213fac999be\" href=\"?note=e8b39213fac999be\" title=\"20-thm-relative-complement\">20-thm-relative-complement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0f7cd94927463198\" href=\"?note=0f7cd94927463198\" title=\"20-thm-hierarchy-closure\">20-thm-hierarchy-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d88d5d86db02e1a1\" href=\"?note=d88d5d86db02e1a1\" title=\"20-thm-bounded-quantifier-closure\">20-thm-bounded-quantifier-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"01d522a0b0df3738\" href=\"?note=01d522a0b0df3738\" title=\"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation\">20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>；所有层级矩阵的基底计算都相对同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8251b2f9fd838667\" href=\"?note=8251b2f9fd838667\" title=\"20-df-rel-arith\">20-df-rel-arith</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"2c15e9656c322806\" href=\"?note=2c15e9656c322806\" title=\"20-df-relative-ce\">20-df-relative-ce</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"2ea8548c98f572c3\" href=\"?note=2ea8548c98f572c3\" title=\"20-thm-jump\">20-thm-jump</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"e8b39213fac999be\" href=\"?note=e8b39213fac999be\" title=\"20-thm-relative-complement\">20-thm-relative-complement</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"0f7cd94927463198\" href=\"?note=0f7cd94927463198\" title=\"20-thm-hierarchy-closure\">20-thm-hierarchy-closure</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"d88d5d86db02e1a1\" href=\"?note=d88d5d86db02e1a1\" title=\"20-thm-bounded-quantifier-closure\">20-thm-bounded-quantifier-closure</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"01d522a0b0df3738\" href=\"?note=01d522a0b0df3738\" title=\"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation\">20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rel\\text{-}post}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nB\\in\\Sigma^A_{n+1}\\Longleftrightarrow B\\in\\mathcal E^{A^{(n)}},\\qquad\nB\\in\\Delta^A_{n+1}\\Longleftrightarrow B\\le_TA^{(n)},\\\\\nn\\ge1\\Rightarrow[A^{(n)}\\in\\Sigma^A_n\\land\\forall C\\in\\Sigma^A_n\\ (C\\le_mA^{(n)})].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rel\\text{-}post}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nB\\in\\Sigma^A_{n+1}\\Longleftrightarrow B\\in\\mathcal E^{A^{(n)}},\\qquad\nB\\in\\Delta^A_{n+1}\\Longleftrightarrow B\\le_TA^{(n)},\\\\\nn\\ge1\\Rightarrow[A^{(n)}\\in\\Sigma^A_n\\land\\forall C\\in\\Sigma^A_n\\ (C\\le_mA^{(n)})].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>同时归纳各层的 c.e. 表征及跳跃层级位置。基例：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\Sigma_1^A\">\\(B\\in\\Sigma_1^A\\)</span> 是某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>-可计算矩阵的存在量化，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> oracle 可搜索见证；反向，有限停止历史的检验 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>-可计算，给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^A\">\\(\\Sigma_1^A\\)</span> 形式。由跳跃的一一完备性，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&#39;\">\\(A&#39;\\)</span> 完全于此类。</p>\n<p>归纳假设已给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^A=\\mathcal E^{A^{(n-1)}}\">\\(\\Sigma_n^A=\\mathcal E^{A^{(n-1)}}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^{(n)}\\in\\Sigma_n^A\">\\(A^{(n)}\\in\\Sigma_n^A\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\Sigma_{n+1}^A\">\\(B\\in\\Sigma_{n+1}^A\\)</span>，写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in B\\iff\\exists y\\ R(x,y)\">\\(x\\in B\\iff\\exists y\\ R(x,y)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\Pi_n^A\">\\(R\\in\\Pi_n^A\\)</span>。其补关系可枚举于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^{(n-1)}\">\\(A^{(n-1)}\\)</span>，因此用该 oracle 的跳跃 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^{(n)}\">\\(A^{(n)}\\)</span> 决定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>，再搜索 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>，给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathcal E^{A^{(n)}}\">\\(B\\in\\mathcal E^{A^{(n)}}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>反向，一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^{(n)}\">\\(A^{(n)}\\)</span>-半判定计算停止有有限历史。每个正 oracle 回答是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^A\">\\(\\Sigma_n^A\\)</span> 条件，每个负回答是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_n^A\">\\(\\Pi_n^A\\)</span> 条件。有限个正、负条件的合取落在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{n+1}^A\">\\(\\Delta_{n+1}^A\\)</span>：分别选成同类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{n+1}^A\">\\(\\Sigma_{n+1}^A\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_{n+1}^A\">\\(\\Pi_{n+1}^A\\)</span> 形式，使用有界量词闭包收集历史中有限多个回答。再存在量化历史代码仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{n+1}^A\">\\(\\Sigma_{n+1}^A\\)</span>。上述矩阵变换在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 基底原样成立，并不把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 当作普通可计算。</p>\n<p>跳跃的一一完备性又给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^{(n+1)}\">\\(A^{(n+1)}\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{n+1}^A\">\\(\\Sigma_{n+1}^A\\)</span> 内且对整类困难，完成归纳。最后，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\Delta_{n+1}^A\">\\(B\\in\\Delta_{n+1}^A\\)</span> 恰当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 与补集均可枚举于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^{(n)}\">\\(A^{(n)}\\)</span>；相对补集定理把它变为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\le_TA^{(n)}\">\\(B\\le_TA^{(n)}\\)</span>。归约的程序指标由有限语法有效编译，编译器为普通全可计算函数，计算矩阵的程序才读取 oracle。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 4.4.2；印刷 92 / PDF 128；归纳细节结合 Theorem 4.2.2 本地展开。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-rel-arith","status":"resolved","id":"8251b2f9fd838667","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-rel-arith]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-relative-ce","status":"resolved","id":"2c15e9656c322806","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-relative-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-jump","status":"resolved","id":"2ea8548c98f572c3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-relative-complement","status":"resolved","id":"e8b39213fac999be","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-relative-complement]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-hierarchy-closure","status":"resolved","id":"0f7cd94927463198","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-hierarchy-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-bounded-quantifier-closure","status":"resolved","id":"d88d5d86d